; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=637, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\Amblygo.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―How many years had passed since then?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Thanks to the bounty gathered here in Arata, I had still suffered no serious illness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I did, naturally, refrain from walking the mountain paths, but I was, more or less, in good health.<PG>
The Grand Witch is obliged to perform the various rites of this settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At memorial services in particular, the nata and the mace are used, so a certain strength of arm is demanded as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Perhaps it is about time I retired as the Grand Witch.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Would it not be best to entrust the rest to the younger generation and quietly wait for my time?<PG>
But...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I feel I have forgotten something important.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For several years, I have been waiting for some kind of news.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What was it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For several years, there has been no word at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though someone was supposed to come and tell me what this settlement needs―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I took up my <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="つえ">cane</STYLE> and left the house.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集落1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Good morning, <STYLE ID="2">Grand Witch-sama</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ah, good morning."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The people of the settlement were in good spirits today as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Under the cold sky, everyone was hard at farm work, <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="おうか">savoring</STYLE> a peaceful life in the settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was a very peaceful place.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集集会所.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Yes, this place was more peaceful than anywhere else.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会場.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A single girl, enshrined in the meeting hall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\女神\ミイラ能面.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
The mummy of a girl called Tomi.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The idol that symbolizes this settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A girl who, nearly 400 years ago, removed her green eyes herself and took her own life.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She gave up her life to protect this settlement.<PG>
Why did this girl take her own life?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why does giving up her life lead to protecting the settlement?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was... 
{PAUSE ""}
if I recall...<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Grand Witch-sama</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会場.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A resident's voice reached my back as I stood facing the mummy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You have a guest. A gentleman by the name of <STYLE ID="4">Shinozaki-san</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Shinozaki</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Who was that? It was a name I had heard before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Some years ago, I believe...
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
